# RMUC 2027 Aerial System Parameter Profile
# Hardware: MicoAir743v2-AIO-35A (PX4 target: micoair_h743-v2)
# Propulsion: 4x 1304plus-11500KV + GF2020 + 2S LiPo (<= 4 Wh)
# VIO: Hessian Matrix RoboBaton Neo (bare 8.69g) on UART4 (TELEM2, 921600)
# Companion: Orange Pi Zero 3W (MAVSDK C++ / ROS 2) on UART1 (TELEM1, 921600)
# RC Kill-Switch (S79): UART6 (RC)
#
# Import via QGroundControl -> Parameters -> Tools -> Load from file (props OFF),
# review diffs, save, and reboot. Do NOT modify motor/IMU calibrations blindly.

# --- Power & ESC (MicoAir743v2-AIO-35A + 2S LiPo <= 4 Wh) ---
1	1	BAT1_N_CELLS	2	6
1	1	BAT1_V_DIV	21.12	9
1	1	BAT1_A_PER_V	14.14	9
1	1	PWM_MAIN_TIM0	-4	6
1	1	MPC_THR_MAX	0.55	9

